  "panels": [
    {
      "content": "<h1>Welcome to sitespeed.io</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.sitespeed.io/\">sitespeed.io</a> | \n<a href=\"https://www.sitespeed.io/documentation/sitespeed.io/\">Documentation</a> | \n<a href=\"https://www.sitespeed.io/documentation/sitespeed.io/performance-dashboard/\">Setup your own dashboard</a> | \n<a href=\"https://github.com/sitespeedio/sitespeed.io/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">Changelog</a> | \n<a href=\"https://opencollective.com/sitespeedio\">Open Collective</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\nStart with the <a href=\"/d/000000060/leaderboard\">Leaderboard</a> to compare your pages, and click a page to open it in <a href=\"/d/9NDMzFfMk/page-metrics\">Page metrics</a>. There, turn on <i>Go to result</i> and click a marker on a graph to open the HTML result of that test.\n</p>\n<p>\n<i>Pages that got slower</i> below lists the pages where the last comparison with the baseline found metrics that got significantly slower. You need to <a href=\"https://www.sitespeed.io/documentation/sitespeed.io/compare/\">compare your tests</a> to get them.\n</p>\n",
      "datasource": "graphite",
      "description": "",
